      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Our Braised Pork is delicious."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "王可： 对不起，我不喜欢吃肉，有蔬菜吗？",
      "traditional": "王可： 對不起，我不喜歡吃肉，有蔬菜嗎？",
